 with passion and love for sports. Though her eyelashes aren’t particularly long, they are distinct, lending a refreshing crispness to her gaze. Her nose is straight, with slightly flared nostrils, showing her post-exercise vigor. Her lips are full and rosy, always curved into a bright smile that reveals even, white teeth, along with an adorable little canine tooth that adds a playful charm. Her hair is tied into a high ponytail, bouncing cheerfully with her movements, strands gleaming golden in the sunlight, full of dynamism.  \n\nAttire: She wears a bright orange sports tank top, its design simple and elegant, highlighting her toned curves and sturdy shoulders. White stripes adorn the top, enhancing its trendy appeal. Paired with black athletic shorts that end mid-thigh, her long, straight legs are on full display. The shorts feature orange stripes on the sides, echoing the tank top. On her feet are white sneakers with orange brand logos—stylish yet comfortable, providing excellent support for her activities. A black sports backpack with silver zippers and accents completes the look, adding a cool edge.  \n\nExpression and Pose: Standing on the school playground, she holds a basketball in one hand, its textured surface clearly visible, while the other hand wipes sweat from her forehead, her face lit with a radiant smile and eyes brimming with confidence and pride. She tilts her head slightly, gazing toward the distant basketball court as if contemplating her next shot. Her legs are slightly apart, body weight lowered, ready to spring into action at any moment. A light breeze lifts her ponytail, and her tank top and shorts sway, accentuating her energy and motion.  \n\nOverall Atmosphere: The playground is lush with green grass, the red rubber track vivid under the sun. Surrounding sports equipment—parallel bars, pull-up bars—and classmates engaged in various activities like running and jump-roping fill the scene with youthful exuberance. The sky is a clear blue, dotted with fluffy white clouds like cotton candy, complementing the vibrant setting. Dominated by orange, black, and white, the scene exudes an energetic, uplifting vibe, highlighting the school belle’s health and spirited charm."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 25, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#593930", "size": [430.7296447753906, 249.5442657470703], "pos": [1083.7745361328125, 1486.4176025390625], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [17], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "LATENT"}], "size": [311.02288818359375, 293.40478515625], "pos": [304.5346984863281, 1437.906982421875], "widgets_values": [1080, 1920, 1], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 15, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [3], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["wan2.2_t2v_low_noise_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [346.2586669921875, 88.26801300048828], "pos": [655.85986328125, 779.44970703125], "id": 14, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.46", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [-236.41181107726425, -429.7594859336848], "scale": 0.5445000000000008}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Group", "bounding": [643, 1385.8930664